+// Closed both ways and exact-matched, like FILL_ALLOWLIST: adding a row is a diff review
+// with a ruling, and a row whose site has moved reds until someone looks at it. The KIND
+// says which law the row is outside of, so a reader can count the classes without reading
+// the prose: shape · signature · graded · layout · loop · prm · elsewhere.
